Description: Export a progressive copy of an interlaced VA surface
 nouveau's video engines decode into field-split buffers, which VA-API
 refused to export, so Chromium and other dma-buf consumers fell back to
 software decoding. Export a progressive buffer instead, which the
 processing path weaves from the fields after every decode into the
 surface.
